1
00:00:36,666 --> 00:00:42,666
No tricks, only treats.

2
00:01:13,333 --> 00:01:19,333
Sing: Thriller is a animation, family, comedy film directed by Garth Jennings.

3
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Buster Moon dreams up a star-studded spectacle set to Michael Jackson's "Thriller" in
this animated short featuring characters from the hit "Sing" films.

4
00:02:26,666 --> 00:02:32,666
Buster Moon (voice), played by Matthew McConaughey.

5
00:03:03,333 --> 00:03:09,333
Meena (voice), played by Tori Kelly.

6
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Gunter (voice), played by Nick Kroll.

7
00:04:16,666 --> 00:04:22,666
Ash (voice), played by Scarlett Johansson.

8
00:04:53,333 --> 00:04:59,333
Johnny (voice), played by Taron Egerton.

9
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,000
Miss Crawly (voice), played by Garth Jennings.

10
00:06:06,666 --> 00:06:12,666
Sing is an American media franchise created by Garth
Jennings and produced by Illumination.

11
00:06:43,333 --> 00:06:49,333
It features the voice talents of Matthew McConaughey, Reese Witherspoon, Scarlett
Johansson, Nick Kroll, Taron Egerton, and Tori Kelly among others.

12
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:26,000
The first film, Sing, was released on December 21, 2016,
and received positive reviews from critics.

13
00:07:56,666 --> 00:08:02,666
The second film, Sing 2, was released on December 22, 2021.

14
00:08:33,333 --> 00:08:39,333
The series has grossed $1 billion worldwide.

15
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:16,000
The franchise takes place in a world inhabited by
talking, anthropomorphic animals.

16
00:09:46,666 --> 00:09:52,666
It follows a koala named Buster Moon who, with the help of other animals,
puts on live theater shows that largely encompass singing.

17
00:10:23,333 --> 00:10:29,333
The tone is lighthearted.
